Welcome to the 2015 graduation ceremony at

00:13:02.942 --> 00:13:07.404
Stanford University's Graduate School
of Business.

00:13:07.404 --> 00:13:17.028
&gt;&gt; [APPLAUSE]

00:13:17.028 --> 00:13:19.076
&gt;&gt; Graduates, as you know,

00:13:19.076 --> 00:13:24.191
