you will lead, manage,

00:13:55.365 --> 00:14:01.481
or found, and through those organizations,
the communities they serve.

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:09.986
What you have accomplished at the GSB,
you have not accomplished alone.

00:14:09.986 --> 00:14:14.592
You have learned and received help,
guidance, mentorship and

00:14:14.592 --> 00:14:19.720
support from many quarters,
all of which are represented here today.

00:14:21.080 --> 00:14:26.330
First, you're sitting shoulder
to shoulder with your classmates

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:28.370
