00:14:29.440 --> 00:14:35.002
Think how much you have learned from one
another in squads, clubs, study trips,

00:14:35.002 --> 00:14:40.830
talk, touchy-feely, or
just in quiet conversation together.

00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:46.350
You have forged bonds here that
will become lifelong friendships,

00:14:46.350 --> 00:14:49.580
which will nurture and
sustain you in the years ahead.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:54.153
Take a moment to show your
